@startuml k9x-stricter-over-time

title The Rules Get Stricter Over Time

rectangle "<b>1. K9X Sentinel</b>\nfinds a new threat" as S
rectangle "<b>2. Human review</b>\nreal gap? (K9X HIL)" as R
rectangle "<b>3. Framework</b>\nnew control + catalog" as F
rectangle "<b>6. Release</b>\nbar goes up for all" as SOL
rectangle "<b>5. Fix sign-off</b>\naudited (K9X HIL, next)" as V
rectangle "<b>4. K9X Inspector</b>\nrule added" as I

S -right-> R
R -right-> F
F -down-> I
I -left-> V
V -left-> SOL
SOL -up-> S : next threat

@enduml
